=\".\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Primitiv datatyp\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <a href=\"StructureDefinition-SEEHDSLMObservations-definitions.html#SEEHDSLMObservations.observations.observationBody.observationValue.intValue\" title=\"Ska ENBART användas för skalvärden (t.ex. poäng på AUDIT-skalan).#xA;Får INTE användas för fysiskt uppmätta värden (längd, vikt etc.) — använd pq för dessa.\">intValue</a><a name=\"SEEHDSLMObservations.observations.observationBody.observationValue.intValue\"> </a></td><td style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: white; border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><td style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: white; border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px\" class=\"hierarchy\">0..1</td><td style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: white; border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px\" class=\"hierarchy\"><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#integer\">integer</a></td><td style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: white; border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px\" class=\"hierarchy\">Heltal (RIV-TA: int).</td></tr>#xD;\n<tr style=\"border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px; vertical-align: top; background-color: #F7F7F7\"><td style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: #F7F7F7; border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px; white-space: nowrap; background-image: url(tbl_bck0010.png)\" class=\"hierarchy\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\".\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_blank.png\" alt=\".\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_blank.png\" alt=\".\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\".\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_datatype.gif\" alt=\".\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Datatyp\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <a href=\"StructureDefinition-SEEHDSLMObservations-definitions.html#SEEHDSLMObservations.observations.observationBody.scale\" title=\"Två huvudtyper: nominalskala (kategorisk) och ordinalskala (rangordnad).#xA;Exempel: AUDIT-skalan (0-40 poäng) eller AB0-blodgruppsystemet.#xA;CVType-regler (TKB): displayName är 1..1 (obligatorisk om fältet anges).#xA;Kardinalitet: Valfri (0..1).\">scale</a><a name=\"SEEHDSLMObservations.observations.observationBody.scale\"> </a></td><td style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: #F7F7F7; border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><td style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: #F7F7F7; border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px\" class=\"hierarchy\">0..1</td><td style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: #F7F7F7; border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px\" class=\"hierarchy\"><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#CodeableConcept\">CodeableConcept</a></td><td style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: #F7F7F7; border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px\" class=\"hierarchy\">NI 2017 (Observation.skala) — den mätskala som värdet är uppmätt på.</td></tr>#xD;\n<tr style=\"border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px; vertical-align: top; background-color: white\"><td style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: white; border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px; white-space: nowrap; background-image: url(tbl_bck0010.png)\" class=\"hierarchy\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\".\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_blank.png\" alt=\".\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_blank.png\" alt=\".\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\".\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_datatype.gif\" alt=\".\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Datatyp\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <a href=\"StructureDefinition-SEEHDSLMObservations-definitions.html#SEEHDSLMObservations.observations.observationBody.observationStatus\" title=\"Koder tillhandahålls av Socialstyrelsen som urval ur Snomed CT (urvals-id: 56431000052106).#xA;Snomed CT OID: 1.2.752.116.2.1.1.#xA;En instans av klassen observation kan inte byta status.#xA;CVType-regler (TKB): displayName är 1..1 (obligatorisk).#xA;Kardinalitet: Obligatorisk (1..1).\">observationStatus</a><a name=\"SEEHDSLMObservations.observations.observationBody.observationStatus\"> </a></td><td style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: white; border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><td style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: white; border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px\" class=\"hierarchy\">1..1</td><td style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: white; border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px\" class=\"hierarchy\"><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#CodeableConcept\">CodeableConcept</a></td><td style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: white; border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px\" class=\"hierarchy\">NI 2017 (Observation.status) — observationens status.<br class=\"binding\"/><span style=\"font-weight:bold\" title=\"null\" class=\"binding\">Bindning: </span><a href=\"ValueSet-se-observation-status-vs.html\" title=\"https://fhir.inera.se/ig/ehds-tk/ValueSet/se-observation-status-vs\" class=\"binding\">SE Observation Status (SNOMED CT urval 5643100005210